  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the real numbers that satisfy the equation $|2x+5|=13.$ So, we first need to solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|2x+5| & =13 \\\\ 2x+5 & =\\pm 13 \\\\ 2x & =-5\\pm 13 \\\\ x & =\\frac{-5\\pm 13}{2} \\\\ x & =-9,4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solutions are $x=-9$ and $x=4,$ and both of these solutions are real numbers.\n\nTherefore, we can write the given set as\n\n$$\nA={-9,4}.\n$$",
